WEBVTT

01:41.009 --> 01:44.270
[A Moment But Forever]

01:44.920 --> 01:47.220
[Episode 16]

01:52.470 --> 01:53.390
It's getting dark.

01:53.390 --> 01:54.070
Shouldn't we

01:54.070 --> 01:55.350
find a place to stay for the night?

01:57.110 --> 01:58.310
There's a house ahead.

02:06.390 --> 02:07.710
I never expected

02:07.710 --> 02:08.470
to see you

02:08.470 --> 02:10.030
again so soon, sir.

02:11.150 --> 02:11.870
I knew

02:11.870 --> 02:13.390
you'd come to my place.

02:13.630 --> 02:14.390
Come in.

02:14.390 --> 02:15.110
Come on, come on.

02:15.110 --> 02:15.860
Come in.

02:17.640 --> 02:20.480
[Library]

02:26.750 --> 02:27.550
Is it

02:27.550 --> 02:29.260
usually just you here, sir?

02:29.390 --> 02:30.030
Yes.

02:30.030 --> 02:31.829
I am the caretaker of this library.

02:31.829 --> 02:33.310
You can call me Bao.

02:34.150 --> 02:35.070
This library

02:35.070 --> 02:36.560
looks quite old.

02:36.670 --> 02:38.590
I wonder when it was built.

02:38.770 --> 02:39.930
Oh, that was a long time ago.

02:40.470 --> 02:42.480
Back then, when the Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain

02:42.700 --> 02:43.950
passed through this area,

02:43.950 --> 02:45.800
she saw the people living in poverty,

02:45.800 --> 02:47.310
so she used her magic

02:48.370 --> 02:50.540
to instantly create this library

02:50.740 --> 02:53.230
to spread knowledge and enlighten the people.

02:53.400 --> 02:54.550
If you really want to count the years,

02:55.030 --> 02:56.810
it's been several hundred years.

02:57.100 --> 02:58.350
The Mute of Wu Mountain?

02:58.380 --> 02:59.180
Yeah.

03:00.630 --> 03:02.390
You've heard of the Mute Goddess too?

03:03.140 --> 03:05.190
I've heard that she was very knowledgeable,

03:05.280 --> 03:06.190
kind, and intelligent,

03:06.190 --> 03:06.870
and that she did a lot of

03:06.870 --> 03:08.270
good things for the people.

03:08.800 --> 03:10.390
This book records

03:10.390 --> 03:11.670
many of her past deeds.

03:11.670 --> 03:12.870
How much can such a thin book

03:12.870 --> 03:14.270
really record?

03:14.430 --> 03:16.860
There are many legends about the Mute Goddess.

03:16.950 --> 03:18.110
When I have time later,

03:18.110 --> 03:19.510
I'll tell you all about them.

03:21.030 --> 03:23.150
There are over a hundred

03:23.150 --> 03:24.270
libraries like this in the Eastern Wilderness,

03:24.310 --> 03:26.400
all built by the Mute Goddess.

03:26.590 --> 03:27.829
The collections inside

03:27.950 --> 03:29.829
were all left by her.

03:29.870 --> 03:31.550
Too many to count.

03:33.070 --> 03:35.270
These are all treasures

03:35.350 --> 03:36.110
the Mute Goddess left for us

03:36.110 --> 03:38.230
to pass down from generation to generation.

03:38.470 --> 03:39.910
She was really amazing,

03:39.910 --> 03:40.900
not only helping common people

03:40.900 --> 03:42.230
by doing so many good deeds

03:42.390 --> 03:43.990
but also writing so many great books.

03:44.190 --> 03:45.000
Yes, indeed.

03:45.310 --> 03:46.110
Young lady,

03:47.270 --> 03:50.030
the Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain is a god.

03:51.110 --> 03:51.910
A god?

03:52.350 --> 03:53.150
Yeah.

03:53.390 --> 03:55.150
She descended from the heavens, riding a phoenix.

03:55.430 --> 03:56.270
Wherever she went,

03:56.270 --> 03:58.030
deserts transformed into lush oases.

03:58.490 --> 04:00.200
Vicious thugs would abandon their wicked ways

04:00.220 --> 04:01.630
upon seeing her,

04:02.430 --> 04:03.710
while the kind-hearted would

04:03.710 --> 04:05.240
receive blessings

04:05.490 --> 04:06.570
and good fortune.

04:07.070 --> 04:08.270
And the ignorant,

04:08.270 --> 04:09.870
those simple and foolish ones,

04:09.910 --> 04:11.840
would become extremely intelligent

04:11.840 --> 04:13.710
the moment she touched their heads.

04:14.870 --> 04:16.029
But why

04:16.510 --> 04:17.829
is she called the Mute Goddess?

04:18.220 --> 04:19.070
Is it because...

04:19.709 --> 04:21.079
she couldn't speak?

04:21.790 --> 04:23.910
The Mute Goddess possessed boundless magical powers.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.470
Her words commanded reality.

04:25.510 --> 04:27.070
Whatever she said would come true.

04:27.430 --> 04:28.240
So,

04:29.350 --> 04:30.860
she rarely opened her mouth to speak.

04:32.820 --> 04:33.630
Isn't that a bit

04:33.630 --> 04:34.630
exaggerated?

04:34.630 --> 04:36.000
How am I exaggerating?

04:36.110 --> 04:37.710
Everything I said is true.

04:37.830 --> 04:39.270
It's all written in the books.

04:39.310 --> 04:39.990
Come on, come on.

04:39.990 --> 04:41.130
I'll find them and show you now.

04:41.150 --> 04:42.190
No need, no need.

04:42.230 --> 04:43.180
Reality and legend

04:43.180 --> 04:44.430
are two different things, after all.

04:44.630 --> 04:46.670
Reading it would just be a waste of time.

04:47.190 --> 04:48.350
So you're saying

04:48.350 --> 04:50.070
everything written in the books is false?

04:50.390 --> 04:52.390
This library sheltering you for the night

04:52.390 --> 04:53.300
is fake?

04:53.300 --> 04:54.550
Even all the good deeds

04:54.550 --> 04:55.430
that the Mute Goddess did

04:55.430 --> 04:56.710
are just made up?

04:58.630 --> 04:59.990
That's not what he meant.

05:00.010 --> 05:01.060
Then what did he mean?

05:01.430 --> 05:02.460
Since all the people of the Eastern Wilderness

05:02.460 --> 05:03.390
all tell these stories

05:03.630 --> 05:05.750
and are willing to worship the Mute Goddess,

05:05.990 --> 05:07.790
there must be a reason for it!

05:07.790 --> 05:08.390
Since you're now

05:08.390 --> 05:10.070
taking shelter in one of the libraries

05:10.070 --> 05:11.190
she built,

05:11.230 --> 05:12.710
you should respect her

05:12.710 --> 05:13.710
and be grateful to her!

05:14.670 --> 05:15.350
Bao,

05:15.350 --> 05:16.150
where are you going?

05:16.230 --> 05:17.150
Don't call me "Bao."

05:17.150 --> 05:18.110
We're not that close.

05:18.110 --> 05:18.870
Wait,

05:18.910 --> 05:19.710
where are the rooms?

05:20.390 --> 05:22.070
Downstairs. Find it yourself!

05:27.230 --> 05:28.590
This is a storage room.

05:28.590 --> 05:30.230
This Bao is not being very hospitable.

05:30.780 --> 05:31.720
Just make do.

05:32.230 --> 05:33.150
Why complain so much?

05:33.480 --> 05:34.070
Just now,

05:34.070 --> 05:35.310
why didn't you let me speak?

05:37.420 --> 05:38.460
I just thought

05:38.510 --> 05:39.230
that since we're

05:39.230 --> 05:40.390
staying at someone else's place,

05:40.390 --> 05:42.030
even if you don't want to agree with him,

05:42.030 --> 05:44.040
at least you shouldn't make him angry.

05:53.850 --> 05:55.240
I don't think she's acting.

05:55.280 --> 05:57.040
She's probably not the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

06:29.870 --> 06:31.390
You've written this character wrong.

06:34.190 --> 06:34.990
Why are you

06:34.990 --> 06:36.390
standing behind me without making a sound?

06:36.390 --> 06:37.470
You startled me.

06:38.310 --> 06:39.190
I'm sorry.

06:39.190 --> 06:40.750
I didn't mean to disturb you.

06:40.920 --> 06:41.710
But

06:42.150 --> 06:44.390
you did write that character wrong.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.670
Impossible.

06:49.590 --> 06:51.159
I copied it from the book exactly.

06:52.710 --> 06:53.510
Look,

06:54.470 --> 06:55.430
that book of yours

06:55.430 --> 06:57.190
has been damaged by bookworms.

06:57.190 --> 06:59.150
This phrase should be

06:59.190 --> 07:00.350
"Winter ice can be broken;

07:00.550 --> 07:01.990
summer twigs can be tied."

07:02.350 --> 07:03.430
It means

07:03.480 --> 07:05.270
that in winter, we obtain ice,

07:05.380 --> 07:07.220
while in summer, we can gather twigs.

07:08.250 --> 07:09.050
See,

07:09.070 --> 07:10.270
there's an extra dot here.

07:29.270 --> 07:30.470
You're right.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.150
I misread it.

07:34.030 --> 07:34.630
Well...

07:34.630 --> 07:35.350
Bao,

07:35.670 --> 07:36.950
you can't read?

07:37.150 --> 07:37.950
That's right.

07:38.870 --> 07:41.270
Then... how do you write?

07:41.310 --> 07:42.790
Just copy it exactly as I see it.

07:44.020 --> 07:44.700
I copied it wrong,

07:44.870 --> 07:45.950
and I've copied so much.

07:46.090 --> 07:47.880
I need to correct them quickly.

07:48.980 --> 07:50.350
Do you have to recopy everything?

07:51.350 --> 07:52.310
That's not necessary.

07:52.730 --> 07:54.650
I only copied this one character wrong.

07:55.060 --> 07:55.870
So,

07:56.790 --> 07:58.350
I just need to recopy this page

07:58.350 --> 08:00.190
and rebind it later.

08:00.870 --> 08:01.680
But

08:02.150 --> 08:03.270
if you can't read,

08:03.830 --> 08:04.710
why are you

08:04.710 --> 08:06.060
copying these books?

08:06.710 --> 08:09.110
Although the Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain

08:09.110 --> 08:10.310
watches over us,

08:10.480 --> 08:11.260
we still

08:11.260 --> 08:12.910
need to do our part.

08:13.390 --> 08:15.230
These books are very precious.

08:15.630 --> 08:16.670
These books are vulnerable

08:16.670 --> 08:17.870
to fire, moisture, and insects.

08:18.270 --> 08:19.390
So I figured

08:19.630 --> 08:20.870
I should make more copies.

08:21.550 --> 08:25.120
If they ever get damaged or destroyed,

08:25.790 --> 08:27.110
at least there will be backups.

08:27.350 --> 08:28.430
That way, the children won't

08:28.430 --> 08:29.670
be left without books to read, right?

08:30.550 --> 08:31.870
Even though

08:32.070 --> 08:34.070
fewer people read books these days,

08:34.230 --> 08:35.030
there will surely

08:35.590 --> 08:37.669
be more in the future.

08:38.789 --> 08:40.190
Then let me help you copy them.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.720
That's great!

08:44.830 --> 08:45.780
One piece for Yuanzhong.

08:46.310 --> 08:47.120
One piece for me.

08:47.830 --> 08:48.830
One piece for Zi Fei.

08:49.270 --> 08:50.070
One piece for me.

08:51.080 --> 08:52.150
One piece for Ji Tanyin...

08:54.030 --> 08:54.830
You think you have too much?

08:55.500 --> 08:56.750
No, whether it's too much or not is one thing,

08:56.750 --> 08:58.750
but is it appropriate to divide it like this?

08:58.900 --> 09:00.470
Aren't I just dividing it in order?

09:00.550 --> 09:01.790
What order?

09:01.790 --> 09:02.990
My order.

09:33.910 --> 09:34.710
What's wrong?

09:34.740 --> 09:36.460
D-Did I write something wrong?

09:37.270 --> 09:38.110
Your handwriting...

09:38.990 --> 09:40.350
is very good.

09:42.790 --> 09:43.590
Wait a moment.

09:44.030 --> 09:45.430
Let me show you something nice.

10:01.550 --> 10:03.190
These are the original manuscripts

10:03.190 --> 10:04.870
left by the Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain.

10:05.030 --> 10:06.870
Only these few volumes remain now.

10:07.710 --> 10:08.510
Take a look.

10:19.870 --> 10:21.470
Right? Doesn't it look similar?

10:22.670 --> 10:24.110
Your handwriting

10:24.110 --> 10:25.230
is just like the Goddess's.

10:25.870 --> 10:27.430
Both are written very well.

10:33.350 --> 10:34.150
Bao.

10:35.470 --> 10:36.430
What was

10:37.270 --> 10:38.750
this place called before?

10:39.050 --> 10:40.200
Rammed Earth City.

10:41.440 --> 10:42.350
That's not right.

10:43.110 --> 10:44.190
A long time ago,

10:44.990 --> 10:46.190
the river to the south

10:46.190 --> 10:47.310
hadn't split into multiple streams yet.

10:47.470 --> 10:48.830
Whenever there was heavy rain,

10:48.830 --> 10:50.550
it could potentially cause flooding.

10:51.190 --> 10:52.590
The landscape at that time...

10:55.150 --> 10:56.840
was quite different from what it is now.

10:57.210 --> 10:58.540
Oh, you mean back then?

11:00.190 --> 11:02.230
At that time, this place was called Chaotic Cloud Village.

11:02.540 --> 11:04.470
This area had strong winds and many clouds.

11:04.670 --> 11:06.350
The dark clouds in the sky...

11:06.990 --> 11:07.790
well...

11:08.190 --> 11:08.980
Anyway,

11:09.230 --> 11:10.630
it was very chaotic around here back then.

11:10.630 --> 11:12.270
That's why it got that name.

11:12.630 --> 11:14.550
Later, the Mute Goddess

11:14.710 --> 11:17.790
built the library using the rammed earth technique,

11:17.790 --> 11:19.550
and then more and more people settled here.

11:20.070 --> 11:21.820
So it was renamed Rammed Earth City.

11:26.250 --> 11:27.690
Chaotic Cloud Village...

11:35.350 --> 11:36.750
No wonder this place felt

11:36.750 --> 11:38.230
somewhat familiar on my way here.

11:38.910 --> 11:39.950
Chaotic Cloud Village...

11:40.260 --> 11:41.550
When I came here back then,

11:41.580 --> 11:43.070
there were only a dozen households.

11:43.270 --> 11:44.590
Those books were also mine.

11:45.030 --> 11:46.830
Could I be the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain?

11:47.670 --> 11:49.590
But why would they call me "Mute"?

11:50.140 --> 11:50.940
Oh, right.

11:51.190 --> 11:52.840
When I crossed the Sea of Flux back then,

11:52.840 --> 11:53.830
I was severely injured.

11:53.850 --> 11:55.180
My throat hadn't recovered yet.

11:55.270 --> 11:56.670
So I was indeed both deaf and mute at that time.

11:57.030 --> 11:59.230
But I didn't ride a phoenix,

11:59.230 --> 12:00.830
nor did I have the power to make my words command reality.

12:07.190 --> 12:08.390
Why are you still up?

12:10.190 --> 12:11.230
I'm not tired yet.

12:11.390 --> 12:12.390
You weren't here just now.

12:12.590 --> 12:13.430
Where did you go?

12:14.590 --> 12:15.980
I went to copy books for Bao.

12:18.070 --> 12:19.200
Don't listen to his nonsense.

12:20.150 --> 12:21.390
The phoenix is a divine beast

12:21.670 --> 12:22.790
with a proud nature.

12:22.830 --> 12:23.510
It would never

12:23.510 --> 12:24.990
serve as a mount for anyone.

12:25.310 --> 12:26.110
That Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

12:26.110 --> 12:27.390
did have some power,

12:27.790 --> 12:29.110
but she was far from

12:29.110 --> 12:30.310
being able to command reality with her words

12:30.430 --> 12:31.990
or enlightening others with a mere touch to the head.

12:32.140 --> 12:33.700
Our clan also has some

12:33.720 --> 12:35.130
legends about gods,

12:35.350 --> 12:36.790
but none as powerful

12:36.990 --> 12:37.950
as that.

12:39.430 --> 12:40.070
Then why

12:40.070 --> 12:41.430
do they still spread such stories?

12:44.000 --> 12:45.230
So-called legends

12:45.550 --> 12:46.350
are nothing more than

12:46.350 --> 12:48.380
stories passed down orally by people.

12:48.670 --> 12:49.590
Since these are stories,

12:49.590 --> 12:50.310
there are

12:50.350 --> 12:52.470
some embellishments and exaggerations.

12:52.910 --> 12:54.310
To make the stories stand out,

12:54.350 --> 12:55.270
people add

12:55.270 --> 12:57.540
their own speculations and interpretations.

12:57.750 --> 12:58.710
As these stories spread from person to person,

12:58.710 --> 12:59.950
they become more and more far-fetched.

13:00.430 --> 13:02.070
Rather than saying they believe in and worship gods,

13:02.150 --> 13:03.910
it's more accurate to say they hope the gods

13:03.910 --> 13:05.430
are as they imagine them to be,

13:05.590 --> 13:07.190
doing what they hope will be done

13:07.440 --> 13:09.150
and fulfilling the wishes they long for.

13:09.910 --> 13:10.710
So,

13:11.030 --> 13:12.790
although they worship the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain,

13:12.790 --> 13:13.710
in reality,

13:13.790 --> 13:15.230
they are worshipping

13:15.230 --> 13:16.860
their own expectations for a better life?

13:18.550 --> 13:19.510
Sort of.

13:22.510 --> 13:23.630
Why do I feel

13:23.650 --> 13:24.750
that you seem to really dislike

13:24.750 --> 13:25.860
the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain?

13:27.680 --> 13:28.950
Why should I like her?

13:40.670 --> 13:41.470
Come on.

13:42.470 --> 13:43.960
Take this to eat on your way.

13:44.510 --> 13:45.260
That's not necessary.

13:45.260 --> 13:46.270
We already have plenty

13:46.270 --> 13:47.270
of food.

13:47.900 --> 13:49.310
This is jerky I made myself.

13:49.390 --> 13:50.540
It tastes really good.

13:50.780 --> 13:51.670
Take it, take it.

13:52.150 --> 13:53.550
Thank you, Bao.

13:55.080 --> 13:56.110
There are books inside.

13:56.710 --> 13:58.110
Read more books when you have time

13:58.110 --> 13:59.230
and learn more things.

13:59.340 --> 14:00.890
Don't stay a handmaiden to someone else.

14:01.590 --> 14:02.430
Not only is it exhausting work,

14:02.430 --> 14:03.710
but you're bound to be mistreated.

14:08.950 --> 14:09.750
Well, he

14:10.210 --> 14:12.150
just likes to get into the details sometimes

14:13.030 --> 14:14.380
and is not good at saying nice things.

14:14.440 --> 14:15.030
But actually,

14:15.030 --> 14:16.390
he's a decent person.

14:17.870 --> 14:18.550
Oh, right.

14:20.660 --> 14:23.030
He asked me to leave this for you.

14:27.620 --> 14:28.390
Give it back to him.

14:28.390 --> 14:29.590
I don't want his money.

14:29.650 --> 14:31.000
He already knows that he was wrong.

14:31.790 --> 14:32.990
He's just too proud—

14:32.990 --> 14:34.870
too embarrassed to apologize to you in person.

14:35.230 --> 14:36.660
So he left this

14:36.660 --> 14:37.870
as an apology.

14:39.790 --> 14:40.590
Really?

15:27.640 --> 15:28.600
That brat...

15:29.670 --> 15:31.150
is not that bad.

15:41.870 --> 15:42.710
What's wrong?

15:44.060 --> 15:45.910
Kai Shan snored too loudly last night.

15:46.420 --> 15:48.660
I didn't sleep well. My eyes hurt.

15:48.970 --> 15:50.210
Then rest a bit more.

16:15.950 --> 16:17.190
Do your eyes still hurt?

16:46.380 --> 16:47.170
How are you feeling now?

16:49.980 --> 16:50.910
Where did you learn that?

16:51.630 --> 16:52.430
Just...

16:52.660 --> 16:53.990
read it in a book earlier.

16:55.380 --> 16:56.230
Don't bother learning

16:56.230 --> 16:57.350
this nonsense.

16:57.910 --> 16:58.710
What's wrong?

16:58.990 --> 17:00.020
That wasn't helping?

17:14.150 --> 17:15.109
I think it feels quite nice.

17:16.910 --> 17:17.750
I'm going to sleep.

17:18.310 --> 17:19.260
Don't disturb me.

18:06.430 --> 18:07.510
The size here

18:07.510 --> 18:08.550
needs to be adjusted again.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.470
Okay.

18:15.980 --> 18:17.950
This part still needs to be modified.

18:17.950 --> 18:18.750
This really won't do.

18:18.750 --> 18:19.110
It's too much!

18:19.110 --> 18:20.070
Yes, that's it.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.630
Young Master,

18:22.190 --> 18:23.200
look who's here?

18:23.830 --> 18:24.630
-Young Master.
-Young Master.

18:25.050 --> 18:26.010
Chiyi, Xiazhi.

18:26.150 --> 18:27.110
How are you doing?

18:27.180 --> 18:28.020
Everything's fine.

18:28.050 --> 18:30.170
Just... not quite used to living here.

18:30.860 --> 18:32.550
The High Priest said you would come to us.

18:32.790 --> 18:34.030
We've been waiting for you for a long time.

18:36.070 --> 18:37.590
It was the High Priest

18:37.670 --> 18:38.840
who saved our lives.

18:40.430 --> 18:41.950
He cares about all of you.

18:42.240 --> 18:43.540
It was all my fault. My reckless actions

18:43.750 --> 18:45.180
nearly cost you your lives.

18:45.990 --> 18:46.790
Young Master,

18:46.810 --> 18:47.810
please don't say that.

18:47.990 --> 18:49.670
From beginning to end,

18:50.270 --> 18:51.480
this was all our own choice.

18:53.470 --> 18:54.270
Young Master,

18:54.750 --> 18:55.750
you've come to Yandu

18:55.880 --> 18:57.470
to discuss joining forces with the human race

18:57.470 --> 18:59.070
against the War Demon?

18:59.070 --> 19:00.220
Yes, that's exactly why.

19:04.830 --> 19:05.630
What's wrong?

19:05.870 --> 19:06.670
Young Master,

19:07.550 --> 19:09.060
there's been unrest in Yandu lately.

19:09.220 --> 19:10.470
Have you heard about the Wushuang Society?

19:13.020 --> 19:13.870
This Wushuang Society

19:13.870 --> 19:14.990
is a human organization

19:14.990 --> 19:15.910
that first surfaced

19:15.910 --> 19:17.110
over a decade ago.

19:17.380 --> 19:18.850
From the Eastern Wilderness to the Western Desert,

19:19.150 --> 19:20.870
wherever there are human activities,

19:20.870 --> 19:22.110
there are their members.

19:22.790 --> 19:23.470
They claim

19:23.470 --> 19:24.830
to serve the "Goddess Wushuang"

19:24.860 --> 19:25.780
and say that the Youhu Clan

19:25.870 --> 19:27.590
is the greatest threat to the human race.

19:28.190 --> 19:30.030
In secret, they've been rapidly recruiting members,

19:30.150 --> 19:31.200
growing ever more ambitious.

19:31.430 --> 19:32.230
In recent years,

19:32.470 --> 19:34.130
they've completely gone underground,

19:34.390 --> 19:35.630
with unknown intentions.

19:36.070 --> 19:37.630
There's an organization like that.

19:37.870 --> 19:39.100
Xiazhi and I

19:39.100 --> 19:40.590
stumbled upon some clues.

19:41.550 --> 19:42.590
This Wushuang Society

19:43.160 --> 19:45.030
seems to be secretly supporting

19:45.030 --> 19:45.950
some people in the city

19:45.950 --> 19:47.390
to trade with the War Demon.

19:48.220 --> 19:49.220
Is this true?

19:49.380 --> 19:50.610
There's absolutely no speculation.

19:50.900 --> 19:51.850
It has been confirmed

19:51.920 --> 19:53.810
that there's a Green Garden Trading House in the city

19:53.910 --> 19:55.470
secretly trading in raw stones.

19:55.850 --> 19:56.800
The amount is so large

19:57.110 --> 19:57.990
that it's dozens of times

19:57.990 --> 19:59.100
what's recorded in their accounts.

19:59.270 --> 20:00.430
And all of these raw stones

20:00.660 --> 20:02.380
are being transported to the Eastern Wilderness.

20:03.910 --> 20:04.790
The Eastern Wilderness?

20:07.630 --> 20:09.020
Before I left Baitou Mountain,

20:09.310 --> 20:11.070
the High Priest gave me a clue.

20:11.770 --> 20:12.950
It's about the War Demons'

20:12.950 --> 20:14.750
hiding places in the Eastern Wilderness.

20:15.550 --> 20:17.150
But we're in Yandu now.

20:17.430 --> 20:18.820
We should first follow the trail

20:18.990 --> 20:20.350
to find their contact person.

20:22.150 --> 20:23.070
Xiazhi and I

20:23.070 --> 20:24.790
have investigated secretly several times,

20:25.000 --> 20:26.470
but they are heavily on guard and vigilant,

20:27.160 --> 20:28.920
constantly leading us in circles.

20:29.230 --> 20:30.030
However,

20:30.390 --> 20:31.950
we're not completely empty-handed.

20:32.530 --> 20:33.500
What did you find out?

20:33.950 --> 20:35.670
The current proprietor of Green Garden Trading House

20:35.670 --> 20:36.950
has been to Fangwai Mountain before.

20:37.470 --> 20:38.750
This woman is named Lyu Yao,

20:38.750 --> 20:39.780
the only daughter

20:39.780 --> 20:41.230
of the former proprietor of Green Garden Trading House.

20:41.310 --> 20:42.910
Because she admired our Youhu Clan,

20:42.910 --> 20:44.270
at the Handmaiden Selection,

20:44.500 --> 20:45.870
she passed through numerous tests

20:45.870 --> 20:46.830
and became

20:46.830 --> 20:47.790
a handmaiden at Fangwai Mountain.

20:48.390 --> 20:50.100
Later, due to her father's sudden death,

20:50.130 --> 20:51.180
she returned home for the funeral

20:51.820 --> 20:53.110
and never went back to the mountain.

20:53.300 --> 20:55.180
Humans have always valued filial piety.

20:55.670 --> 20:57.150
Is there anything suspicious about this?

20:58.350 --> 20:59.300
But her father,

21:00.020 --> 21:01.340
that former proprietor,

21:01.470 --> 21:03.380
had already died three years ago.

21:28.670 --> 21:29.470
Young Master,

21:29.930 --> 21:30.810
what's wrong?

21:32.310 --> 21:33.110
Nothing.

21:33.620 --> 21:34.430
Let's go.

21:39.550 --> 21:40.340
Who are you?

21:44.630 --> 21:45.470
Young Mistress Dai?

21:45.920 --> 21:47.120
Quickly, report to the Young City Lord.

21:47.350 --> 21:48.150
Yes, sir.

21:48.240 --> 21:49.320
Greetings, Young Mistress Dai.

21:53.180 --> 21:56.220
[City Lord's Mansion]

22:12.190 --> 22:13.790
-Greetings, Young Mistress Dai!
-Greetings, Young Mistress Dai!

22:18.300 --> 22:19.110
Dai.

22:20.630 --> 22:21.670
Is it really you, Dai?

22:29.610 --> 22:31.440
[Zhi Yue; Young City Lord of Yandu; Human]

22:33.830 --> 22:34.630
Zhi Yue

22:35.230 --> 22:36.360
greets Elder Sister.

22:42.550 --> 22:43.430
That eastern pavilion

22:43.790 --> 22:44.870
and this corridor

22:44.890 --> 22:46.360
were both newly built two years ago.

22:47.330 --> 22:48.310
The pond in front

22:48.310 --> 22:49.420
has remained unchanged.

22:50.190 --> 22:51.510
The elders in our family say

22:52.270 --> 22:53.110
that when I was little,

22:53.110 --> 22:54.670
I often sneaked in there to play.

22:54.910 --> 22:56.550
I got scolded quite a bit for that.

22:56.870 --> 22:57.670
Dai,

22:58.070 --> 22:59.190
do you remember?

23:01.070 --> 23:01.790
When I left,

23:01.790 --> 23:03.070
you were just

23:03.110 --> 23:04.200
a mischievous little child.

23:06.710 --> 23:08.510
This used to be a training ground, right?

23:09.070 --> 23:09.870
I remember that Father

23:09.870 --> 23:11.390
often practiced martial arts here.

23:12.430 --> 23:13.230
Where is Father?

23:14.270 --> 23:15.110
After taking

23:15.110 --> 23:16.590
the Essence Nourishing Pill that Shen Ying sent,

23:16.590 --> 23:17.990
he has been in seclusion, absorbing it.

23:18.300 --> 23:19.940
I believe that in a few more days,

23:20.150 --> 23:21.750
he'll be able to come out and see us.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.830
If he sees that you've returned,

23:23.850 --> 23:25.380
he'll surely be overjoyed.

23:27.310 --> 23:28.110
Dai,

23:28.550 --> 23:29.950
after Father takes the pill,

23:29.950 --> 23:31.670
will he return to his youth like you?

23:32.670 --> 23:33.470
I don't know.

23:33.910 --> 23:34.910
Maybe.

23:37.190 --> 23:39.150
These years, I've often wandered abroad,

23:39.190 --> 23:40.070
and you've been helping Father

23:40.070 --> 23:41.780
with everything at home.

23:41.960 --> 23:42.800
Thank you for your hard work.

23:43.860 --> 23:45.730
There's no need to say such things among family.

23:46.350 --> 23:47.150
Dai,

23:47.300 --> 23:49.550
having you back is better than anything.

23:50.110 --> 23:51.630
I'm very pleased to see that you can now

23:51.870 --> 23:53.310
handle things on your own.

23:54.930 --> 23:56.130
Dai, you flatter me.

23:58.230 --> 23:59.910
There used to be a rockery here,

24:00.430 --> 24:01.870
but it collapsed due to heavy rain,

24:01.870 --> 24:02.990
so we simply removed it altogether.

24:04.110 --> 24:04.910
The buildings behind

24:04.910 --> 24:06.750
were all built at the same time.

24:07.350 --> 24:08.780
There's also a terrace on the top floor.

24:09.350 --> 24:10.300
On a good night,

24:10.730 --> 24:13.130
it's the perfect place for moon-gazing and drinking.

24:18.820 --> 24:21.930
[Ningrui Pavilion]

24:29.340 --> 24:30.150
This place

24:30.790 --> 24:32.110
hasn't changed at all.

24:33.620 --> 24:35.020
Father doesn't allow anyone to move things around.

24:35.350 --> 24:37.540
Servants clean here every day,

24:37.980 --> 24:40.150
and everything is arranged as it was.

24:40.220 --> 24:41.270
It's exactly the same

24:41.300 --> 24:42.300
as it was when you left.

24:44.740 --> 24:46.410
I was too willful back then.

24:52.350 --> 24:53.150
Zhi Yue.

24:53.540 --> 24:54.240
I found something

24:54.260 --> 24:55.460
on my way back this time.

24:55.870 --> 24:56.670
What is it?

25:07.960 --> 25:09.650
Dai, what is it

25:09.910 --> 25:11.010
that makes you so cautious?

25:11.100 --> 25:13.180
The War Demons have returned.

25:14.670 --> 25:16.070
This is no joke.

25:17.030 --> 25:18.070
Are you sure?

25:19.270 --> 25:20.060
I'm sure.

25:21.030 --> 25:22.470
The War Demon used the possessing technique

25:22.470 --> 25:23.630
to harm the Youhu Clan

25:23.670 --> 25:25.430
and also killed one of our human handmaidens.

25:26.020 --> 25:26.820
I originally

25:26.910 --> 25:28.580
wanted to leave this matter for Father to decide.

25:29.870 --> 25:31.030
But given the current situation,

25:31.030 --> 25:32.430
I'm afraid the War Demon will have already begun

25:32.450 --> 25:34.180
causing havoc by the time he comes out of seclusion.

25:39.450 --> 25:40.940
This is a matter of great importance.

25:42.160 --> 25:44.560
Dai, your information is very timely.

25:48.390 --> 25:51.830
[Orange Lake]

25:52.150 --> 25:53.030
We've arrived.

25:54.110 --> 25:55.820
Finally, we can have a good meal.

25:58.590 --> 26:00.240
Let's find an inn to settle in first.

26:00.390 --> 26:01.190
Okay.

26:04.940 --> 26:08.070
[Turn Around]

26:08.510 --> 26:10.310
Today's room fee is five mace;

26:10.390 --> 26:12.630
taking care of him costs one mace,

26:13.920 --> 26:14.720
one and a half mace,

26:15.430 --> 26:17.540
plus three mace for medicine later.

26:18.580 --> 26:19.630
That's 9 mace.

26:20.410 --> 26:21.840
And there's this...

26:23.470 --> 26:24.590
The Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain,

26:24.590 --> 26:25.230
please bless me, Yunniang,

26:25.230 --> 26:26.030
that fortune flows in while sitting at home,

26:26.030 --> 26:26.790
wealth falls from the sky,

26:26.790 --> 26:27.590
easy marks come every day,

26:27.590 --> 26:28.350
rich and generous they'll be,

26:28.350 --> 26:29.110
the penny-pinchers stay out,

26:29.110 --> 26:30.110
and the ugly ones don't make trouble.

26:37.150 --> 26:37.950
Madam,

26:38.510 --> 26:40.030
there's almost no money

26:40.030 --> 26:41.580
left in this money pouch.

26:41.790 --> 26:43.040
Should we throw that guy

26:43.070 --> 26:43.950
out now?

26:48.990 --> 26:50.350
Go to the kitchen and get a knife.

26:50.550 --> 26:51.350
Let's just...

26:51.660 --> 26:52.950
end him with one slash.

26:53.460 --> 26:55.270
No, no, no.

26:55.300 --> 26:56.060
Madam,

26:56.150 --> 26:56.830
I mean, sure,

26:56.830 --> 26:57.870
he owes us some money,

26:57.870 --> 26:59.350
but we shouldn't kill him for that.

26:59.370 --> 27:01.560
Killing someone is against the law.

27:02.340 --> 27:04.340
How would we live afterward?

27:05.950 --> 27:07.030
Oh, so you do know that?

27:07.030 --> 27:07.950
He's so severely injured!

27:07.950 --> 27:08.750
If you throw him out now,

27:08.750 --> 27:09.950
how is that any different from killing him?

27:09.970 --> 27:11.540
Have you lost your conscience?

27:13.540 --> 27:15.030
But that wasn't my idea.

27:15.030 --> 27:16.550
Weren't you the one who instructed earlier

27:16.550 --> 27:17.590
to throw him out

27:17.590 --> 27:18.550
when his money runs out?

27:18.880 --> 27:19.780
I was just saying that casually!

27:19.780 --> 27:21.110
Can't you just take it lightly?

27:21.110 --> 27:22.150
Did you really have to take it so seriously?

27:26.750 --> 27:27.630
We have customers.

27:27.660 --> 27:29.100
Si, we have customers!

27:32.000 --> 27:33.350
Dear customers, are you here to stay

27:33.350 --> 27:34.380
or to dine?

27:34.790 --> 27:35.590
To stay.

27:35.610 --> 27:36.620
Four deluxe rooms.

27:36.870 --> 27:37.630
What a coincidence!

27:37.630 --> 27:39.190
Our inn has exactly four deluxe rooms available.

27:39.190 --> 27:40.340
Please come in.

27:40.780 --> 27:41.590
Si!

27:41.610 --> 27:42.480
Take care of their carriage

27:42.510 --> 27:43.310
and feed the horses well!

27:43.310 --> 27:43.910
Got it.

27:43.910 --> 27:44.510
Come in.

27:44.510 --> 27:44.910
Please come in.

27:44.910 --> 27:45.790
San,

27:45.810 --> 27:47.070
take the customers upstairs!

27:47.070 --> 27:47.790
Got it.

27:47.910 --> 27:48.510
Come on,

27:48.510 --> 27:49.510
this way, please.

27:54.590 --> 27:56.270
Please come in, dear customers.

27:58.110 --> 27:59.030
What do you think?

27:59.150 --> 28:00.030
Are you satisfied?

28:00.950 --> 28:01.750
It's good.

28:02.150 --> 28:04.150
Then I won't disturb your rest.

28:04.190 --> 28:05.000
Hey, buddy.

28:05.390 --> 28:06.540
I'd like to ask you about a place.

28:06.540 --> 28:08.910
Do you know how to get to Orange Lake?

28:09.350 --> 28:10.910
This is Orange Lake, right here.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.830
I'm talking about an actual lake,

28:13.150 --> 28:14.270
not our town.

28:14.950 --> 28:15.950
Oh, you mean that lake.

28:15.950 --> 28:16.530
Yes.

28:16.530 --> 28:17.740
It's over on the west side of town.

28:17.740 --> 28:18.790
Would you mind

28:18.790 --> 28:19.670
showing me the way?

28:19.670 --> 28:20.430
Sure, no problem.

28:20.630 --> 28:21.580
This way, please, sir.

28:21.950 --> 28:23.160
Then I'll go with you.

28:24.110 --> 28:25.270
You should go back to your room and rest.

28:25.310 --> 28:26.830
Zi Fei and Kai Shan will accompany me.

28:26.940 --> 28:27.670
Then...

28:28.190 --> 28:29.430
I'll prepare some food for you

28:29.430 --> 28:30.350
for when you return.

28:51.070 --> 28:51.870
Come in.

29:00.610 --> 29:02.250
I'm Shen Ying, the Foreign Affairs Scribe of Yandu.

29:02.640 --> 29:04.200
Greetings, Mr. Tanghua.

29:04.910 --> 29:05.710
Please, have a seat.

29:06.710 --> 29:07.590
Thank you, Mr. Tanghua.

29:14.710 --> 29:16.990
May I ask why you've

29:17.190 --> 29:18.390
summoned me here?

29:18.830 --> 29:19.710
When I was on the tower ship,

29:19.710 --> 29:21.150
I already told you

29:21.390 --> 29:22.390
that I would come in person

29:22.390 --> 29:23.950
to pay a formal visit to the City Lord of Yandu.

29:24.290 --> 29:27.100
To discuss eliminating the remnants of the War Demons?

29:27.660 --> 29:28.470
That's right.

29:28.710 --> 29:29.510
I have already

29:29.720 --> 29:31.750
reported this to the City Lord.

29:32.230 --> 29:34.070
Now that you're here in person,

29:34.270 --> 29:35.830
it is only right that I arrange

29:35.830 --> 29:37.710
a meeting for you as soon as possible.

29:37.980 --> 29:38.830
"It is only right?"

29:39.110 --> 29:39.910
Yes.

29:40.350 --> 29:42.260
Unfortunately, the timing is not ideal.

29:42.630 --> 29:45.030
The City Lord is currently in seclusion.

29:46.260 --> 29:47.500
"The timing is not ideal?"

29:48.130 --> 29:49.800
Of all times, he chooses to enter seclusion

29:49.830 --> 29:51.350
the moment I arrive?

29:52.890 --> 29:54.240
It really is a coincidence.

29:54.590 --> 29:55.780
But I assure you,

29:55.810 --> 29:57.850
there's no intention to disrespect you.

29:58.590 --> 29:59.390
Fine.

29:59.740 --> 30:01.060
Then I'll wait for him to come out of seclusion.

30:02.630 --> 30:03.750
By the way, Mr. Shen,

30:04.350 --> 30:06.390
have you heard of the Wushuang Society?

30:10.070 --> 30:11.550
Wushuang Society?

30:13.550 --> 30:16.150
I think... I've heard of it.

30:16.590 --> 30:19.070
It should be a guild for craftsmen.

30:19.690 --> 30:21.160
Not just craftsmen, right?

30:23.350 --> 30:25.430
I'm afraid I don't understand.

30:25.470 --> 30:27.270
Please enlighten me, Mr. Tanghua.

30:28.030 --> 30:29.460
It seems this Wushuang Society

30:29.900 --> 30:30.910
has connections with many

30:30.910 --> 30:32.710
merchant guilds in Yandu City

30:33.150 --> 30:34.870
and is secretly aiding the War Demons.

30:35.020 --> 30:37.070
This... this is impossible!

30:39.450 --> 30:41.050
Mr. Shen, do you really not know,

30:41.850 --> 30:42.970
or are you just pretending not to know?

30:45.040 --> 30:45.840
Mr. Tanghua,

30:46.230 --> 30:47.190
where did you hear

30:47.190 --> 30:48.730
such rumors?

30:48.760 --> 30:49.800
This is a serious matter.

30:49.830 --> 30:51.590
We mustn't jump to conclusions based on hearsay.

30:51.950 --> 30:52.710
Without evidence,

30:52.710 --> 30:54.380
how could I make such baseless claims?

30:55.230 --> 30:56.790
The fact that War Demon remnants still exist

30:56.790 --> 30:58.220
is undeniable.

30:58.630 --> 31:00.030
They're hiding and lying low,

31:00.070 --> 31:01.670
which means they are struggling to survive.

31:01.920 --> 31:03.820
If no other forces had been lending a hand,

31:03.910 --> 31:05.710
I don't believe they could have remained hidden for so long.

31:07.640 --> 31:09.510
Now, the three major races dominate the world.

31:09.910 --> 31:11.230
My Youhu Clan and the War Demons

31:11.230 --> 31:12.920
have an irreconcilable blood feud.

31:13.470 --> 31:15.100
As for who has been aiding them,

31:15.710 --> 31:16.830
isn't that obvious?

31:18.230 --> 31:19.870
Mr. Tanghua, you are mistaken.

31:20.310 --> 31:21.820
The Youhu Clan and the War Demon

31:21.820 --> 31:23.470
indeed have a deep blood feud.

31:23.750 --> 31:25.230
But our human race has also suffered greatly

31:25.230 --> 31:26.950
from the War Demon's slaughter and enslavement.

31:27.390 --> 31:28.910
Their atrocities

31:28.910 --> 31:30.150
are deeply etched in our memories.

31:30.150 --> 31:30.830
Our hatred towards them

31:30.830 --> 31:32.550
is no less than that of your esteemed clan.

31:34.320 --> 31:36.840
This matter must be thoroughly investigated.

31:37.220 --> 31:39.030
We must not let those with ulterior motives

31:39.030 --> 31:40.670
take advantage of this to drive a wedge between us.

31:40.670 --> 31:41.310
Alright.

31:41.670 --> 31:42.430
That's exactly what I was waiting

31:42.430 --> 31:43.630
for you to say.

31:44.550 --> 31:45.830
In the southern part of the city, on Licorice Street,

31:45.910 --> 31:47.310
there's a Green Garden Trading House.

31:47.550 --> 31:49.100
Its proprietor is named Lyu Yao.

31:49.950 --> 31:50.790
Come to think of it,

31:51.070 --> 31:52.200
this person was actually brought back

31:52.200 --> 31:53.350
to Yandu City by you.

31:53.590 --> 31:54.400
Is that right?

31:55.390 --> 31:56.180
Yes.

31:56.620 --> 31:58.150
Her father died suddenly,

31:58.190 --> 31:59.990
so she went back home for the funeral.

32:00.870 --> 32:02.350
Then, let's start investigating from here.

32:03.150 --> 32:04.830
She's had two fathers die within three years.

32:05.150 --> 32:07.110
Let's first find out how many fathers she actually has.

32:27.190 --> 32:29.150
Wonderful, wonderful indeed!

32:30.350 --> 32:31.990
This melody is like a gift from the heavens.

32:32.670 --> 32:34.630
Dai, I didn't know you had such skill with the zither.

32:34.870 --> 32:36.830
It's truly astonishing.

32:37.150 --> 32:38.220
Just playing around.

32:39.820 --> 32:41.270
Aren't you busy with your official duties today?

32:41.750 --> 32:42.710
Though official duties keep me busy,

32:42.710 --> 32:43.710
I can always make time

32:43.710 --> 32:44.680
to see you.

32:45.870 --> 32:46.830
It's strange.

32:46.950 --> 32:48.510
Though I haven't spent much time

32:48.510 --> 32:49.390
with you in this life,

32:49.630 --> 32:51.750
now I find myself thinking of you often.

32:52.110 --> 32:54.590
Perhaps this is what they call the bond of family.

32:55.150 --> 32:56.190
That must be it.

32:57.270 --> 32:58.550
Before you returned,

32:58.550 --> 32:59.300
I worried every day

32:59.300 --> 33:00.710
about Father's seclusion.

33:00.750 --> 33:02.350
Sometimes, I couldn't even eat or sleep properly.

33:02.550 --> 33:03.750
Now, it's different.

33:04.110 --> 33:05.990
Knowing that you are here in the same place,

33:06.110 --> 33:07.150
my heart

33:07.270 --> 33:08.540
feels much more at ease.

33:11.030 --> 33:12.470
I feel the same way.

33:13.100 --> 33:14.250
I have wandered for half of my life,

33:14.520 --> 33:15.980
only to realize now how precious family is.

33:18.710 --> 33:19.470
Dai, just now,

33:19.470 --> 33:20.590
what piece were you playing?

33:20.590 --> 33:21.740
It was so beautiful.

33:22.550 --> 33:23.470
I don't know either.

33:24.400 --> 33:25.590
When Mom taught me,

33:25.670 --> 33:26.830
she never mentioned its name.

33:26.960 --> 33:28.490
It was the First Madam who taught you.

33:31.310 --> 33:33.200
But ever since I can remember,

33:33.710 --> 33:35.270
she had always been bedridden.

33:35.910 --> 33:36.790
I'd never

33:36.790 --> 33:38.230
heard her play the zither.

33:40.630 --> 33:41.390
At that time,

33:41.390 --> 33:42.910
she lived in the Yangyu Tower.

33:43.270 --> 33:44.470
Because she couldn't stand the wind,

33:45.150 --> 33:47.070
the doors and windows were always kept closed.

33:47.590 --> 33:49.070
But I often sneaked in there

33:49.190 --> 33:50.780
and got beaten quite some times for it.

33:51.660 --> 33:53.350
Although Father usually doted on me,

33:53.750 --> 33:54.550
he never

33:54.550 --> 33:56.110
held back when punishing me

33:56.270 --> 33:57.870
if I disturbed First Madam's rest.

33:58.630 --> 33:59.780
But even so,

33:59.950 --> 34:01.270
I would still go there often.

34:01.990 --> 34:03.240
I was young at that time

34:03.270 --> 34:04.120
and didn't know any better.

34:04.590 --> 34:06.790
I had no self-control when it came to food and drink.

34:07.430 --> 34:09.150
I especially loved sweets.

34:09.409 --> 34:11.130
The whole household kept me in check,

34:11.429 --> 34:12.630
except for the First Madam.

34:12.960 --> 34:15.889
Every time I visited, she would give me malt sugar.

34:18.040 --> 34:19.239
I still remember clearly

34:19.270 --> 34:20.790
the night when she left this world.

34:21.679 --> 34:22.600
The wind was still,

34:23.190 --> 34:24.150
and the moon was full.

34:24.989 --> 34:25.659
By then,

34:25.659 --> 34:27.230
she could no longer speak.

34:28.230 --> 34:30.270
But she was still happy to see me.

34:31.750 --> 34:34.550
Finally, with trembling hands,

34:35.230 --> 34:36.710
she gave me one last handful of malt sugar.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.350
Dai.

34:41.670 --> 34:42.630
That handful of malt sugar...

34:44.020 --> 34:44.909
was the sweetest thing

34:44.909 --> 34:46.270
I've ever tasted in my life.

34:53.150 --> 34:54.070
Young Lord and Young Mistress,

34:54.090 --> 34:55.610
Shen Ying, Scribe Shen, requests an audience.

34:56.330 --> 34:57.130
Great.

34:57.570 --> 34:58.450
Please invite him in now.

35:08.620 --> 35:10.940
Shen Ying pays his respects to the Young Lord and Young Mistress.

35:11.430 --> 35:12.990
There's no need for such formalities among our own people.

35:12.990 --> 35:13.950
Please, rise quickly.

35:14.710 --> 35:15.590
Thank you, Young Lord.

35:19.040 --> 35:19.910
You and your father

35:19.910 --> 35:20.990
have been protecting my elder sister

35:20.990 --> 35:22.110
for decades without fail.

35:22.220 --> 35:23.310
This time, not only did you safely

35:23.310 --> 35:24.470
bring her back home,

35:24.630 --> 35:25.830
but you also brought back the medicinal pills.

35:26.110 --> 35:27.750
That is a great merit.

35:28.030 --> 35:29.190
So in my heart,

35:29.190 --> 35:30.990
I've long seen you as family.

35:32.390 --> 35:33.750
Thank you for your kindness, Young City Lord.

35:33.870 --> 35:35.590
I dare not accept such an honor.

35:35.910 --> 35:36.950
What are you afraid of?

35:37.270 --> 35:38.430
When Father comes out of seclusion,

35:38.430 --> 35:39.910
he will surely reward you generously.

35:40.220 --> 35:41.510
You must also continue to work hard,

35:41.510 --> 35:42.480
not slack off,

35:42.590 --> 35:43.990
and make good use of opportunities.

35:44.390 --> 35:45.190
Yes, Young Lord.

35:46.240 --> 35:47.030
Dai,

35:47.320 --> 35:48.660
I still have official duties to attend to.

35:48.840 --> 35:49.880
I'll go take care of them now.

35:50.270 --> 35:51.280
Take care of yourself too.

35:51.280 --> 35:52.000
Don't overwork yourself.

35:52.330 --> 35:53.130
I know.

35:54.150 --> 35:54.950
Goodbye.

36:04.790 --> 36:05.590
Young Mistress Dai,

36:05.610 --> 36:07.290
Mr. Tanghua has come to Yandu.

36:10.670 --> 36:12.260
Where are you gentlemen from?

36:12.270 --> 36:13.000
From the east.

36:13.890 --> 36:15.250
When I was feeding your horses earlier,

36:15.280 --> 36:16.950
I noticed that the wheels of your carriage are badly worn.

36:16.980 --> 36:18.390
You must have traveled a long way.

36:19.470 --> 36:20.350
I have a friend

36:20.350 --> 36:21.790
who specializes in repairing wheels.

36:21.790 --> 36:23.230
Would you need his services?

36:23.230 --> 36:24.350
If needed, I'd be happy to introduce him to you.

36:24.350 --> 36:25.070
If necessary,

36:25.070 --> 36:26.230
we'll certainly trouble you.

36:26.640 --> 36:27.880
How far is it to Orange Lake?

36:28.670 --> 36:29.590
It's right here.

36:30.950 --> 36:32.510
When you mentioned Orange Lake earlier,

36:32.510 --> 36:33.870
it didn't come to me at first.

36:34.030 --> 36:35.230
We locals here

36:35.230 --> 36:36.700
all call it Black Dragon Pool.

36:38.460 --> 36:39.710
Why does this lake

36:39.800 --> 36:41.070
have two names?

36:41.470 --> 36:43.190
Years ago,

36:43.470 --> 36:44.590
the elders of our town

36:44.590 --> 36:46.110
said they saw a black dragon

36:46.110 --> 36:47.350
coiled above the lake at night.

36:47.790 --> 36:48.830
That's why it's called Black Dragon Pool.

36:48.830 --> 36:49.990
But in the past couple of years,

36:49.990 --> 36:50.910
no one has seen it again.

36:51.710 --> 36:52.670
Thank you for leading the way.

36:52.870 --> 36:53.670
Zi Fei.

36:54.050 --> 36:55.370
We still need to look around this place,

36:55.410 --> 36:56.580
so we won't take up any more of your time.

36:57.750 --> 36:58.670
Thank you for the tip, sir.

37:12.850 --> 37:13.640
It's here.

37:14.290 --> 37:15.500
Then let's quickly rescue him.

37:21.230 --> 37:22.030
Lu Chen,

37:22.390 --> 37:23.190
return.

37:30.960 --> 37:32.110
Lu Chen isn't here.

37:32.390 --> 37:33.790
The seal has been broken?

37:34.310 --> 37:35.430
Then where did he go?

37:39.780 --> 37:41.580
I only realized afterward

37:42.190 --> 37:44.390
that Mr. Tanghua had it all planned out.

37:44.870 --> 37:46.310
He wants to use me

37:46.480 --> 37:47.950
to uncover the truth of the matter.

37:48.790 --> 37:50.350
Wasn't Lyu Yao already

37:50.350 --> 37:51.870
secretly imprisoned by you?

37:51.870 --> 37:53.030
How could she brazenly

37:53.030 --> 37:53.830
escape

37:54.070 --> 37:55.660
and get involved with the Wushuang Society?

37:56.790 --> 37:57.590
Indeed.

37:58.220 --> 37:59.620
I find it strange too.

38:00.390 --> 38:01.070
This person

38:01.070 --> 38:03.180
tried to assassinate the Youhu Clan's High Priest.

38:03.310 --> 38:04.500
That's truly insane.

38:05.080 --> 38:06.800
I originally planned to imprison her for a couple of years

38:06.840 --> 38:07.910
as a warning.

38:08.840 --> 38:09.950
But someone, I don't know who,

38:10.470 --> 38:11.810
released her.

38:12.110 --> 38:13.320
No matter who released her,

38:13.590 --> 38:14.310
we can't let her

38:14.310 --> 38:15.500
get away with it like this.

38:15.530 --> 38:16.330
Yes.

38:17.350 --> 38:18.750
As for that Wushuang Society,

38:19.150 --> 38:20.830
if it's really as you say,

38:20.980 --> 38:22.300
it's far too radical.

38:22.710 --> 38:23.790
If left unchecked,

38:23.910 --> 38:24.590
I'm afraid

38:24.590 --> 38:26.230
it might really ignite a war between the two clans.

38:26.710 --> 38:28.190
That's exactly what I'm worried about.

38:29.070 --> 38:29.870
Here's what we'll do:

38:30.040 --> 38:31.790
find a way to investigate the situation.

38:31.870 --> 38:32.670
It would be best if you could

38:32.670 --> 38:33.660
root them out completely.

38:33.950 --> 38:34.750
Understood.

38:35.110 --> 38:36.550
This matter must be handled discreetly.

38:37.030 --> 38:38.870
Try not to arouse any suspicion from the Youhu Clan,

38:39.350 --> 38:40.460
especially

38:40.460 --> 38:41.470
Mr. Tanghua.

38:42.070 --> 38:43.830
We need to nip it in the bud before he does,

38:43.850 --> 38:45.580
to prevent exacerbating the conflict between our two clans

38:45.610 --> 38:46.610
and causing misunderstandings.

38:47.910 --> 38:48.910
Yes, Young Mistress.

38:52.030 --> 38:53.310
With Lu Chen's abilities,

38:53.310 --> 38:53.870
could he have

38:53.870 --> 38:55.310
broken the seal himself?

38:55.750 --> 38:57.390
He must have encountered something unexpected.

38:58.230 --> 38:59.510
No matter what he encountered,

38:59.510 --> 39:00.710
since the seal has been broken,

39:00.710 --> 39:02.150
why hasn't he come to find us?

39:02.990 --> 39:03.580
Stop right there!

39:07.630 --> 39:09.000
[Pei Jiu; Weapon Spirit]

39:21.470 --> 39:22.270
Thank you.

39:33.910 --> 39:35.030
Are you hungry?

39:36.540 --> 39:37.900
Come on. Come in.

39:50.820 --> 39:51.610
Here you go.

39:57.360 --> 39:58.210
Eat slowly.

39:58.240 --> 39:59.350
Don't choke yourself.

40:02.510 --> 40:03.310
Si!

40:03.750 --> 40:04.470
Stop what you're doing

40:04.470 --> 40:05.750
and throw out that freeloader!

40:06.400 --> 40:07.210
Who?

40:07.350 --> 40:07.870
In this inn,

40:07.870 --> 40:09.310
who else is freeloading?

40:10.730 --> 40:11.770
Thank you, sister.

40:13.780 --> 40:14.980
You mean the one in the backyard?

40:15.020 --> 40:16.020
Yes, that's him.

40:17.010 --> 40:18.250
But he's so badly injured

40:18.400 --> 40:19.720
and hasn't woken up yet.

40:19.760 --> 40:20.670
If you throw him out,

40:20.670 --> 40:21.700
won't he end up dying on the streets?

40:21.700 --> 40:22.190
We can't just

40:22.190 --> 40:23.480
keep letting him stay here.

40:23.480 --> 40:24.830
Business is so tough these days!

40:24.830 --> 40:25.550
From morning till now,

40:25.550 --> 40:26.430
we've had only one table of customers.

40:26.430 --> 40:27.630
I'm barely keeping this small inn open,

40:27.630 --> 40:28.150
and I can hardly

40:28.150 --> 40:29.310
pay your wages.

40:29.460 --> 40:30.670
I'd like to help him,

40:30.750 --> 40:32.510
but I just can't afford to.

40:32.530 --> 40:33.750
But didn't you say this morning...

40:33.750 --> 40:34.350
Wh-Wh-What

40:34.350 --> 40:35.470
did I say?

40:35.740 --> 40:36.910
Who is that person?

40:37.890 --> 40:39.450
Who knows who he is?

40:39.630 --> 40:40.790
I encountered him while I was out.

40:40.790 --> 40:41.310
Out of compassion,

40:41.310 --> 40:42.470
I brought him back to save him.

40:42.470 --> 40:43.150
That man

40:43.150 --> 40:43.910
is severely injured

40:43.910 --> 40:45.070
and has remained unconscious.

40:45.070 --> 40:46.550
But calling a doctor costs money,

40:46.550 --> 40:47.950
and so does buying medicine.

40:47.970 --> 40:49.530
I really can't afford this anymore.

40:49.580 --> 40:50.590
If I had any savings at all,

40:50.610 --> 40:52.130
I certainly wouldn't turn a blind eye to him.

40:55.700 --> 40:56.670
However, I think

40:56.670 --> 40:57.480
this person should wake up

40:57.480 --> 40:58.880
in another ten days or so.

40:58.930 --> 41:00.270
But what if he doesn't wake up?

41:00.270 --> 41:01.790
I still have this small inn to run.

41:02.020 --> 41:03.540
I need to make a living too, right?

41:03.820 --> 41:04.830
But I can't bring myself

41:04.830 --> 41:06.070
to throw him out.

41:09.910 --> 41:10.710
Miss,

41:10.980 --> 41:12.510
why don't you give me some advice?

41:12.880 --> 41:13.670
Me?

41:14.550 --> 41:15.500
Do you think

41:15.500 --> 41:16.550
I should throw him out

41:16.550 --> 41:17.750
or not?

41:18.750 --> 41:20.030
Of course, you can't throw him out.

41:20.670 --> 41:21.350
That's right.

41:21.350 --> 41:22.510
Miss, you're right.

41:22.510 --> 41:23.000
You see,

41:23.000 --> 41:23.630
this young lady also said

41:23.630 --> 41:24.830
that we can't just let him die.

41:26.320 --> 41:27.710
You have such a kind heart, miss.

41:30.270 --> 41:32.250
But who's going to pay for  his room?

41:32.830 --> 41:34.070
I can waive the room fee,

41:34.070 --> 41:34.880
but someone needs to

41:34.880 --> 41:35.830
take care of him, right?

41:35.910 --> 41:36.710
Well,

41:36.990 --> 41:38.030
who's going to pay for the labor?

41:38.070 --> 41:39.140
Who's going to pay for the medicine?

41:39.170 --> 41:40.920
Where can we get all this money?

41:43.950 --> 41:45.100
Miss, you don't know

41:45.100 --> 41:46.630
where we're supposed to get all this money?

41:46.830 --> 41:47.990
I don't know.

41:49.770 --> 41:52.050
Miss, you could pay for him.

41:52.550 --> 41:53.790
I can see you have a kind heart.

41:53.790 --> 41:54.990
You were even willing to help a little beggar,

41:55.030 --> 41:56.670
so surely you can help him too, right?

41:56.900 --> 41:58.220
I don't have any money.

41:59.350 --> 42:00.630
Miss, you're dressed so well,

42:00.650 --> 42:01.600
yet you have no money?

42:02.790 --> 42:04.430
I really don't have any money.

42:05.070 --> 42:06.030
Then what about

42:06.030 --> 42:06.940
that young man who came with you?

42:08.950 --> 42:09.760
He has.

42:09.890 --> 42:10.970
Can he pay?

42:11.110 --> 42:11.920
He can!

42:13.190 --> 42:14.710
See? Problem solved.

42:14.710 --> 42:15.270
Come on, come on.

42:15.270 --> 42:15.990
Come with me.

42:18.830 --> 42:19.630
Come on, come on.

42:22.500 --> 42:23.310
It's him.

42:24.170 --> 42:25.070
You

42:25.070 --> 42:26.710
are truly lucky to have met a savior.

42:26.750 --> 42:28.310
Open your eyes and take a good look at her.

42:28.670 --> 42:29.830
Even if you die,

42:29.830 --> 42:31.110
you must remember this person well

42:31.110 --> 42:32.510
so that you can repay her in your next life.

42:32.670 --> 42:34.430
She's agreed to pay for your room,

42:34.470 --> 42:35.670
hire a doctor to prescribe medicine for you,

42:35.670 --> 42:36.950
and have Si take care of you!

42:37.430 --> 42:38.590
Is he badly injured?

42:38.590 --> 42:39.710
How long has he been unconscious?

42:39.810 --> 42:40.750
Since I brought him back,

42:40.750 --> 42:42.000
he's been lying here the whole time.

42:42.020 --> 42:43.150
I felt sorry for him,

42:43.150 --> 42:44.390
and that's why I brought him back.

42:44.390 --> 42:45.390
I don't know, but somehow,

42:45.390 --> 42:46.550
he's managed to hold on until now.

42:46.820 --> 42:47.860
He's got a strong fate

42:47.880 --> 42:48.690
and good fortune.

42:48.900 --> 42:50.470
How else could he have waited for you?

42:55.550 --> 42:56.830
He's about to wake up!

42:57.490 --> 42:58.780
He's the type who knows how to repay kindness.

42:58.810 --> 42:59.830
You saved his life.

42:59.850 --> 43:01.030
He definitely won't forget you.
